{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/linar-alef-group-al-mamzar","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1478,"crm_id":"8337","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Linar","slug":"linar-alef-group-al-mamzar","display_address":"Al Mamzar beach","building_type":["apartment","penthouse"],"completion_year":"2030","developer":"Alef Group","price":849000,"display_price":"849k","lattitude":25.30544000329,"longitude":55.361174007708,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Alef Linar Sharjah is a waterfront residential community by Alef Group, set on the east edge of Al Mamzar beach. Spread across 5.5 hectares, the development brings together 5 residential towers and a future commercial tower.</p><p>The residential collection includes <strong>1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments alongside a limited release of 4-bedroom penthouses</strong>, with prices starting from AED 849,000. Each residence is built for comfort and connectivity, with floor-to-ceiling proportions, porcelain finishes and spacious balconies that open to uninterrupted views of the Arabian Gulf.</p><p>Linar by Alef is located on Corniche and Al Taawun Street, with direct links to Al Wuheida Road and Al Ittihad Road. Once completed, residents will enjoy a fully integrated community of retail, dining, co-working spaces, sports courts, lap pools, gyms, and curated wellness areas.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_059720d949.jpg","hash":"Feature_059720d949","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_073dc14b09.jpg","hash":"Banner_073dc14b09","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_11_210706a7df.jpg","hash":"Gallery_11_210706a7df","name":"Gallery-11.jpg