05ad23310a.jpg","hash":"Selling_Point_05ad23310a","name":"Selling-Point.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"A Waterfront Lifestyle Like No Other","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Beachfront Location - Set on the east edge of Al Mamzar beach, with direct waterfront positioning.</li><li>360-Degree Views - Uninterrupted panoramas of the Arabian Gulf, the Sharjah skyline, and the desert horizon.</li><li>Flexible Unit Mix - 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments alongside a limited collection of 4-bedroom penthouses.</li><li>Accessible Entry - Prices start from AED 849,000 for a 1-bedroom apartment.</li><li>Master-Planned Community - 5 residential towers and a future commercial tower across 5.5 hectares.</li><li>Strategic Connectivity - Positioned on Corniche and Al Taawun Street, with Dubai International Airport reachable in under 15 minutes.</li><li>Integrated Lifestyle Ecosystem - Retail, dining, co-working spaces, sports courts, and curated social spaces built into the community.</li><li>Resort-Style Amenities - Lap pools, family pools, male and female gyms, yoga zones, and a Level 6 amenity deck.</li><li>Smart Homes- Smart home systems, individual AC control, LED lighting, EV charging, and external Wi-Fi across all residences.</li><li>Sustainability-Led Design - Rubberized asphalt internal roads, lower-carbon concrete, and photovoltaic panels integrated into the project's infrastructure.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2195,"cta":{"id":3027,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":null,"isExternal":false,"custom_link":null},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_v_2_d5e77122a7.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_v_2_d5e77122a7","name":"Map-Location-v.2.jpg"},"style":null,"title":null,"heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[{"id":52,"place_name":"Dubai Border (via Al Ittihad Road)","time_distance":"4 minutes